    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;</strong>OKeverything:Evil Boy 1001 Sinful Reincarnations<strong>&quot; - A Dark Interactive Novel</strong><br>When the law fails, the gods step in.<br>11-year-old Wang Chengcheng escapes punishment for murder due to his age, but his death triggers a divine sentence: 1001 lifetimes as a child criminal, forced to endure the suffering of his victims while powerless to change his fate. <br><strong>Game Features</strong>\uff1a <br>\u2705 Dark, immersive narrative exploring child crime, domestic abuse, and systemic corruption <br>\u2705 Multi-branching storylines with moral dilemmas that shape the protagonist's destiny <br>\u2705 Cinematic storytelling blending gritty realism with mythical elements <br>\u2705 Stunning visuals and atmospheric sound design to heighten emotional intensity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Storylines</strong>\uff1a </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First Reincarnation: Liu Hanbei</strong> - A helpless teenager who was abused by his alcoholic father and bullied by school bullies for a long time;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621870/extras/3ab536a8ac8fca6be32ceeb28d297059.avif?t=1749464205\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621870/extras/7ea01f09a13319272cc0f29c734964b4.avif?t=1749464205\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621870/extras/3bf441a99d4f692f0b1fdafd8f8cd3e2.avif?t=1749464205\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A beautiful mother</strong> - She endured humiliation for his future;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621870/extras/80d7cacf533d473798d6a04a8ce93752.avif?t=1749464205\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621870/extras/d7bd17023f9e8f4ee248e72d82bae8f5.avif?t=1749464205\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621870/extras/4c9edef621406d77652ebba144e77ac5.avif?t=1749464205\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621870/extras/cde7af39e02cfe0cf4885dfb0a405196.avif?t=1749464205\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621870/extras/3d8a7d6985b5f570a8e799155d01482e.avif?t=1749464205\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Punishment</strong> - How will he, who is gradually drowned in hatred, break out and face his own evil?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Note: This game is the first chapter of a long novel, which ends when Liu Hanbei just transferred to an aristocratic school and began to suffer bullying.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Brutally honest and deeply disturbing - a masterpiece of moral ambiguity&quot;<br>&quot;The choices feel impossible, making every playthrough a soul-searching experience&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COME IN</strong> and step into the shoes of the Child of Vengeance. Will you break the cycle... or become its most fearsome agent?</p>",
